  modified or compiled here.

Model files (downloaded from Hugging Face by scripts/prepare.sh; not included in this repository or its image)
  The checkpoint this recipe serves, nvidia/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-FP4-Local, is NVIDIA's quantization-aware-distilled
  FP4 export (NVIDIA Model Optimizer) of Qwen/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next by the Qwen team (Alibaba). Its use is governed by the NVIDIA Open
  Model Agreement (https://www.nvidia.com/en-us/agreements/enterprise-software/nvidia-open-model-agreement/); the base model is under the
  Qwen Community License 1.0 (https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next/blob/main/LICENSE).
  The optional overlay (ABLIT=1), drowzeys/keys-Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVFP4-FP4-QAD-house-qsa-L3-47 by drowzeys, replaces 24 self_attn.o_proj tensors (weight and scale of 12 layers) of
  NVIDIA's checkpoint; it is gated (Responsible Use Agreement) and inherits the NVIDIA Open Model License and the Qwen Community License 1.0. scripts/prepare.sh downloads
  its sidecar only when ABLIT=1; none of its files is part of this repository or its image.

